  "body": "- Fixed a security issue where a database registered using `add_database(db, name=..., route=...)` with a route that differs from its name could be downloaded from `/<route>.db` by actors who were denied access to it. The `view-database-download` and `view-database` permission checks for that URL are now made against the database name. A `permission_allowed()` plugin hook that matched `view-database-download` against the route will now be passed the database name instead."
}
